    "run_collision_resume_note": "M9Trainer.__post_init__ only does 'self.run_root.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)' -- it does not itself check for or refuse a pre-existing completed run in that directory. The NOT_STARTED/IN_PROGRESS/COMPLETED/FAILED_TECHNICAL/BLOCKED_COLLISION state classification below must be enforced by the future additive E8 launcher before it ever calls M9Trainer().",
